function enhanceExpenseForm(overlay){const form=overlay.querySelector('form');if(!form||form.dataset.expenseEnhanced||!form.querySelector('select[name=scope]'))return;form.dataset.expenseEnhanced='1';const house=readProperty().id,role=document.getElementById('accountSelect').value.split('|')[0],amount=form.querySelector('[name=amount]');amount.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',`<label>Ảnh hoá đơn</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" name="receiptFile"><p class="note" data-receipt-note>Bắt buộc khi số tiền trên ${escapeHTML(amountForHouse(expenseLimit(house),house))}.${role==='manager'?' Khoản trên '+escapeHTML(amountForHouse(bigExpenseLimit(house),house))+' phải xin chủ nhà duyệt trước.':''}</p>`);const approved=role==='manager'?myApprovedRequests():[];if(approved.length){form.querySelector('[name=name]').closest('label')?.insertAdjacentHTML?.('beforebegin','');form.querySelector('.modal-head').insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',`<label>Theo đề xuất chi đã duyệt</label><select name="spendRequest"><option value="">Không theo đề xuất</option>${approved.map(r=>`<option value="${escapeHTML(r.id)}">${escapeHTML(r.title)} · tối đa ${escapeHTML(amountForHouse(r.maxAmount,r.house))}</option>`).join('')}</select>`);const sel=form.querySelector('[name=spendRequest]');sel.addEventListener('change',()=>{const r=approved.find(x=>x.id===sel.value);if(r){form.querySelector('[name=name]').value=r.title;amount.value=r.maxAmount;if(r.room){const scope=form.querySelector('[name=scope]');if(scope){scope.value='Phòng riêng';scope.dispatchEvent(new Event('change',{bubbles:true}))}const room=form.querySelector('[name=expenseRoom]');if(room)room.value=r.room}}});if(overlay.dataset.presetRequest){sel.value=overlay.dataset.presetRequest;sel.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'))}}const file=form.querySelector('[name=receiptFile]');file.addEventListener('change',async()=>{form.dataset.receiptPending='1';delete form.dataset.receipt;const f=file.files[0];if(f){try{form.dataset.receipt=await compressInventoryPhoto(f)}catch{}}delete form.dataset.receiptPending});if(overlay.dataset.initialState!==undefined)overlay.dataset.initialState=popupState(overlay)}
new MutationObserver(list=>list.forEach(m=>m.addedNodes.forEach(node=>{if(node.nodeType===1&&node.classList?.contains('modal-overlay')&&/Ghi nhận chi phí/.test(node.querySelector('.modal-head')?.textContent||''))setTimeout(()=>enhanceExpenseForm(node),0)}))).observe(document.querySelector('.phone')||document.body,{childList:true});
document.addEventListener('submit',event=>{const form=event.target;if(!(form instanceof HTMLFormElement)||!form.dataset.expenseEnhanced)return;const house=readProperty().id,[role]=document.getElementById('accountSelect').value.split('|'),amount=Number(form.querySelector('[name=amount]')?.value)||0,name=String(form.querySelector('[name=name]')?.value||'').trim(),stop=(text,extra)=>{event.preventDefault();event.stopImmediatePropagation();let box=form.querySelector('.expense-rule-error');if(!box){box=document.createElement('p');box.className='user-error expense-rule-error';form.querySelector('.modal-actions')?.before(box)}box.hidden=false;box.innerHTML=escapeHTML(text)+(extra||'')};if(form.dataset.receiptPending)return stop('Đang xử lý ảnh hoá đơn, bấm lại sau giây lát.');const reqId=form.querySelector('[name=spendRequest]')?.value||'',req=reqId&&readSpendRequests().find(r=>r.id===reqId);if(role==='manager'&&amount>bigExpenseLimit(house)&&!req)return stop('Khoản trên '+amountForHouse(bigExpenseLimit(house),house)+' phải xin chủ nhà duyệt trước khi chi. ','<button type="button" class="link-btn" data-open-spend-request>Gửi đề xuất chi</button>');if(req&&amount>Number(req.maxAmount)+0.005)return stop('Số tiền vượt mức chủ nhà đã duyệt ('+amountForHouse(req.maxAmount,house)+').');if(amount>expenseLimit(house)&&!form.dataset.receipt)return stop('Khoản trên '+amountForHouse(expenseLimit(house),house)+' cần chụp ảnh hoá đơn.');window.__expenseExtra={name,amount,receipt:form.dataset.receipt||'',requestId:req?req.id:'',at:Date.now()};setTimeout(patchNewExpense,400)},true);
